    "chunk_text": "and hi w\u00e6ron ealle swi\u00f0e gode; Ealle \u00f0ing he geworhte buton \u00e6lcum antimbre; He cw\u00e6\u00f0; Geweor\u00f0e leoht.and \u00f0\u00e6rrihte w\u00e6s leoht geworden; He cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft.geweor\u00f0e heofen.and \u00fe\u00e6rrihte w\u00e6s heofen geworht.swa swa he mid his wisdome.and He cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft.and het \u00f0a eor\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t heo sceolde for\u00f0l\u00e6dan cuce nytenu.and he \u00f0a gesceop of \u00f0\u00e6re Ealswa eft of w\u00e6tere he gesceop fixas and fugelas.and sealde \u00f0am fixum sund.and \u00f0am fugelum \u00dea \u00f0a he worhte \u00f0one mann adam.he ne cw\u00e6\u00f0 na.geweor\u00f0e man geworht.ac he cw\u00e6\u00f0 uton For \u00f0i is se man betera gif he gode ge\u00f0ih\u00f0.\u00feonne ealle \u00f0a nytenu sindon.for \u00f0an \u00f0e hi ealle Heo ne geenda\u00f0 n\u00e6fre; Se lichama is deadlic \u00feurh adames gylt.ac \u00f0eah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere god ar\u00e6r\u00f0 eft \u00f0one lichaman to ecum Nu cw\u00e6don gedwolmen \u00fe\u00e6t deofol gesceope sume gesceafta.ac hi leoga\u00f0; Ne m\u00e6g he nane gesceafta gescyppan.for \u00f0an \u00f0e he nis na scyppend.ac is atelic sceocca.ac mid Swa hw\u00e6t swa is on gesceaftum wi\u00f0erweardlic ge\u00feuht and mannum derige.\u00fe\u00e6t is eall for urum \u00dea ongeat se deofol \u00fe\u00e6t adam and eua w\u00e6ron to \u00f0y gesceapene.",
